  "name": "Mexican Botana Platter",
  "subtitle": "Layered chips, beans, seasoned meats, cheese, and fresh toppings",
  "description": "A hearty shareable platter layered with crisp corn tortilla chips, refried beans, seasoned beef and chicken, melted cheese, guacamole, sour cream, and fresh vegetables.",
